        t["NOISE"]["poisson"] = LearnEntry{"Swaps the periodic internal clock for a FREE Poisson process — SH/SMTH update at random times, not tied to a clock. RATE becomes the mean rate.", "The interval is a mix between the regular period and an exponential draw (t = −ln(U)/λ); poisson=1 is pure Poisson. Ignored if TRIG is connected.", "It is the \"Geiger counter\" — the pair of the BOXCAR's GEIG output (#51). Seeded: two identical renders."};
