        t["SWIRL"]["type"] = LearnEntry{"0 CHORUS (2 voices, it fattens) · 1 FLANGER (1 short delay + feedback, jet/comb) · 2 ENSEMBLE (3 voices, Juno/Solina) · 3 PHASER (a cascade of all-passes, a moving notch).", "The first three are modulated SHORT delays; the phaser swaps the delay line for 6 first-order all-passes — a hollower, less metallic timbre.", "Compare FLANGER and PHASER at the same RATE/DEPTH: the comb sweeps metallic, the notch sweeps hollow."};
